      "type": "raw",
      "html": "<div class=\"form\"><label class=\"fld\"><span>Question</span><i>Accrediting the Phoenix Cup as a rating tournament</i></label><label class=\"fld\"><span>Explanation</span><i class=\"area\">Inclusion in the official rating of the 2026/2027 season under the all-Ukrainian tournament regulations.</i></label><div class=\"fld\"><span>Scope</span><div class=\"pick\"><b class=\"on\">Board</b><b>Supervisory board</b><b>General assembly</b><b>AKS</b><b>Poll</b></div><small>who may sign: here the 5 members of the leadership</small></div><label class=\"fld\"><span>Case</span><i>C-2026-09 Phoenix Cup accreditation</i></label><div class=\"two\"><label class=\"fld\"><span>Open until</span><i>18.10.2026 23:59</i></label><label class=\"fld\"><span>Quorum</span><i>more than half, 3 of 5</i></label></div><div class=\"fld\"><span>Ballot</span><div class=\"pick\"><b class=\"on\">Named</b><b>Secret</b></div><small>board votes are named; general assembly votes are secret</small></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "text": "Once started a vote cannot be edited, only withdrawn with a reason, which is kept. Board decisions are taken by board vote; the supervisory board and the AKS vote in their own scopes."
    },
    {
      "type": "raw",
      "html": "<div class=\"foot\">Debate Federation of Ukraine (NGO). dfu.uadebate.com is for members of the organisation only.</div>"
